REQUEST FOR PROPOSAL (RFP) - GROUP MEDICLAIM INSURANCE POLICY
Ref No: RFP-GM-2025-0042 | Date: February 15, 2025
Issuing Organization: National Power Transmission Corporation
Target Prospect / Insured: State Bank of India
Proposed Policy Term: 1 April 2025 – 31 March 2026 (12 Months)

1. PROPOSED COVERAGE & SUM INSURED
Coverage Line                                Sum Insured / Limit                          Retentions & Deductibles
Group Mediclaim (Employees & Dependents)     ₹5,00,000 per family floater                 Nil Deductible
Critical Illness Coverage Extension          ₹2,00,000 per insured life                   30-day survival period
Maternity & Neonatal Benefit                 ₹75,000 normal / ₹1,00,000 caesarean         9-month waiting period waived

2. PRICING & PREMIUM STRUCTURE
Estimated Annual Gross Premium: INR 18.5 Crore (Inclusive of GST)
Installment Structure: 4 Equal Quarterly Payments of INR 4.625 Crore payable in advance.

3. MANDATORY UNDERWRITING CONDITIONS PRECEDENT
1. Insurer must maintain IRDAI Solvency Margin ratio strictly above 1.50x.
2. Submit quarterly audited claim settlement ratios within 30 days of quarter end.
3. 100% cashless claims facility across empaneled network hospitals.

4. KEY POLICY EXCLUSIONS
Unstated Pre-Existing Illnesses: Covered from Day 1 for active employees and spouses.
Sovereign War & Combat: Standard war and nuclear hazard exclusion.
Cosmetic & Aesthetic Surgery: Excluded unless required post-accidental trauma.

5. CLAIMS & HOSPITAL NETWORK ADMINISTRATION
Third Party Administrator (TPA) / In-house claims desk must provide cashless authorization within 2 hours.
Nationwide network hospital tie-ups required covering at least 8,500 hospitals.
